    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The seas were calm. Your mission, simple. And then, everything changed. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now, a restless dread grips you and your crew. Deep down, you feel it - something <i>unwanted</i> is on board.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/d87abb473d557e75dd476b07fc158c04.poster.avif?t=1750357939\" width=616 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/d87abb473d557e75dd476b07fc158c04.webm?t=1750357939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/d87abb473d557e75dd476b07fc158c04.mp4?t=1750357939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Second-in-Command</strong> of the <strong>33rd Fleet</strong>: now only a single Warship, but still a respected and feared one. Alongside your Captain and Third-in-Command, you lead the crew through treacherous waters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/22e6e48d34a816975b41b0960e95b339.poster.avif?t=1750357939\" width=616 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/22e6e48d34a816975b41b0960e95b339.webm?t=1750357939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/22e6e48d34a816975b41b0960e95b339.mp4?t=1750357939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your primary goal is the extraction of an anomaly lost at sea.</strong><br> There are <strong>four locations</strong>--but only <strong>three days</strong> to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The secrets you miss may never reveal themselves again:<br><strong><i>Choose wisely.</i></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/cfa15a5c3f776bc3ff0706f7e7ab37f7.poster.avif?t=1750357939\" width=616 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/cfa15a5c3f776bc3ff0706f7e7ab37f7.webm?t=1750357939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/cfa15a5c3f776bc3ff0706f7e7ab37f7.mp4?t=1750357939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrangle the crew, preserve loyalties, and protect your sanity.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea may not be your only enemy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the mystery, or die trying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose a side, don't look back.</i></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>The seas were calm. Your mission, simple. And then, everything changed. </strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Now, a restless dread grips you and your crew. Deep down, you feel it - something <i>unwanted</i> is on board.\u00a0</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/d87abb473d557e75dd476b07fc158c04.poster.avif?t=1750357939\" width=616 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/d87abb473d557e75dd476b07fc158c04.webm?t=1750357939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/d87abb473d557e75dd476b07fc158c04.mp4?t=1750357939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You are the <strong>Second-in-Command</strong> of the <strong>33rd Fleet</strong>: now only a single Warship, but still a respected and feared one. Alongside your Captain and Third-in-Command, you lead the crew through treacherous waters.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/22e6e48d34a816975b41b0960e95b339.poster.avif?t=1750357939\" width=616 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/22e6e48d34a816975b41b0960e95b339.webm?t=1750357939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/22e6e48d34a816975b41b0960e95b339.mp4?t=1750357939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Your primary goal is the extraction of an anomaly lost at sea.</strong><br> There are <strong>four locations</strong>--but only <strong>three days</strong> to explore.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The secrets you miss may never reveal themselves again:<br><strong><i>Choose wisely.</i></strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/cfa15a5c3f776bc3ff0706f7e7ab37f7.poster.avif?t=1750357939\" width=616 height=722 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/cfa15a5c3f776bc3ff0706f7e7ab37f7.webm?t=1750357939\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3703340/extras/cfa15a5c3f776bc3ff0706f7e7ab37f7.mp4?t=1750357939\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Wrangle the crew, preserve loyalties, and protect your sanity.</strong>\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The sea may not be your only enemy.\u00a0</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Solve the mystery, or die trying.</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>Choose a side, don't look back.</i></p>",
    "short_description": "In this mystery horror visual novel, help lead a loyal crew across deadly waters. Encounter beasts, explore forgotten seas, but most importantly: don't let this become your final voyage. A deeper mystery looms, and the sea is not your only enemy. Choose a side; don't look back.",
